                <pb facs="0364" n="324" sameAs="frus:frus1865p1/pg324"/>

                <p>[Enclosures.]</p>
                <p>1. Mr. Stanton to Mr. Seward, March 27, 1865.</p>
                <p>2. General Grant to Mr. Stanton, March 25, 1865.</p>
                <p>3. General Lee to General Grant, March 23, 1865.</p>
                <p>4. Lord Russell to Messrs. Mason, Slidell and Mann, February 13, 1865.</p>
                <p>[The above enclosures, marked 1, 2 and 3, are published in connexion with Mr.
                    Seward’s despatch No. 1325, and No. 4 with Mr. Adams’s No. 879, current
                    series.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
